WEBVTT

00:01.233 --> 00:04.233
[upbeat dramatic music]
[欢快的戏剧音乐]

00:04.233 --> 00:11.099
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:11.099 --> 00:14.466
- The Aquaphone, the
Mermalair's telecommunication
- 水听器，
Mermalair 的电信

00:14.466 --> 00:16.099
device connecting city hall
连接市政厅的设备

00:16.099 --> 00:17.533
with the underwater
crime-fighting
与水下的
打击犯罪

00:17.533 --> 00:20.066
hero,
Mermaid Man.
英雄，
美人鱼男.

00:20.066 --> 00:21.599
- Yello?
- 耶罗？

00:21.599 --> 00:24.133
- Never mind.
It's just this idiot.
- 没关系。
就是这个白痴而已。

00:24.133 --> 00:27.299
- Argh!
- 啊啊！

00:27.299 --> 00:29.233
- By the power of Neptune...
- 凭借海王星的力量...

00:29.233 --> 00:33.299
both: Mermaid
Man and Barnacle Boy unite!
两者：美人鱼
男人和藤壶男孩联合起来！

00:33.299 --> 00:35.499
- To the invisible boatmobile.
- 到隐形的移动船。

00:35.499 --> 00:37.866
- Yay.
- 耶。

00:37.866 --> 00:40.399
[both imitating engine revving]
[两者都模仿发动机转速]

00:49.433 --> 00:52.233
- This must be the secret lair
of an evil villain.
- 这一定是秘密巢穴
一个邪恶的恶棍。

00:52.233 --> 00:55.233
- You're right.
- 你说得对。

00:55.233 --> 00:57.299
- Wah-ha!
- 哇哈！

00:58.899 --> 00:59.999
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

00:59.999 --> 01:01.233
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

01:01.233 --> 01:04.699
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:04.699 --> 01:06.666
- Oh!
- 哦！

01:06.666 --> 01:10.233
Looks like there's evil afoot.
看来有邪恶在作祟。

01:10.233 --> 01:12.299
- And littering is a crime.
- What?
- 乱扔垃圾是犯罪行为。
- 什么？

01:12.299 --> 01:16.033
I thought I had my house
sponge-and-star-proofed.
我以为我有我的房子
海绵和星星防护。

01:16.033 --> 01:17.566
- Hey, Squidward, want to play
Mermaid Man
- 嘿，章鱼哥，想玩吗
人鱼男

01:17.566 --> 01:19.033
and Barnacle Boy with us?
藤壶男孩和我们在一起吗？

01:19.033 --> 01:20.266
- No!
- 不！

01:20.266 --> 01:23.266
Now, please fall and get
seriously hurt.
现在，请跌倒并获得
严重受伤。

01:23.266 --> 01:25.133
both: Ahh!
两人：啊！

01:25.133 --> 01:28.399
- Ugh! Oof!
- 呃！钱币！

01:28.399 --> 01:30.733
- I'm sure I've heard that "no"
before.
- 我确信我听到过“不”
之前。

01:30.733 --> 01:33.633
- Holy something, Mermaid Man.
You can't mean--
- 神圣的东西，美人鱼男人。
你不可能是说——

01:33.633 --> 01:35.499
- Yes, my young, pink ward.
- 是的，我年轻的粉红色病房。

01:35.499 --> 01:39.233
It's none other than...
不是别人，正是...

01:39.233 --> 01:40.666
Doctor Negative.
医生阴性。

01:40.666 --> 01:43.599
- * I hate SpongeBob, and I hate
Patrick *
- * 我讨厌海绵宝宝，我也讨厌
帕特里克*

01:43.599 --> 01:46.233
- It's that denying desperado's
siren song.
- 这就是否认亡命之徒的
海妖之歌。

01:46.233 --> 01:49.966
- * Loathing SpongeBob, scorning
Patrick la-la-la-la-la-la *
- * 厌恶海绵宝宝，蔑视
帕特里克啦啦啦啦啦啦啦*

01:49.966 --> 01:53.066
- He's obviously raising an army
of mutant vegetables.
- 他显然正在组建一支军队
突变蔬菜。

01:53.066 --> 01:54.666
And that song he's singing...
还有他唱的那首歌...

01:54.666 --> 01:56.833
both: Will bring them to life.
两者：将使它们栩栩如生。

01:56.833 --> 01:58.233
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

01:58.233 --> 01:59.699
both: Hyah!
两人：哈！

01:59.699 --> 02:01.899
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:11.666 --> 02:13.599
Although our foes were evil,
尽管我们的敌人是邪恶的，

02:13.599 --> 02:17.399
their nutrition did not go to
waste, Doctor Negative.
他们的营养没有去
浪费，阴性医生。

02:17.399 --> 02:20.033
- We're watching you.
- 我们正在看着你。

02:20.033 --> 02:21.433
- That's it!
- 就是这样！

02:21.433 --> 02:24.833
I'm gonna clobber you two!
我要打倒你们两个！

02:26.733 --> 02:28.233
- Hey, Squidward, do you hear
that?
- 嘿，章鱼哥，你听到了吗
那个？

02:28.233 --> 02:29.699
[whistle blowing]
[吹口哨]

02:29.699 --> 02:31.399
You better hurry up or you'll be
late for work.
你最好快点，否则你会
上班迟到了。

02:31.399 --> 02:35.766
- Yeah, you better do something
or whatever.
- 是的，你最好做点什么
或其他什么。

02:38.233 --> 02:41.366
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:44.399 --> 02:48.633
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:48.633 --> 02:49.833
Ohh.
哦。

02:49.833 --> 02:51.633
- Ahh-ahh-ahh!
- 啊啊啊啊！

02:55.066 --> 03:00.566
- * Mermaid Man, our hero
Barnacle Boy, you too *
- * 美人鱼人，我们的英雄
藤壶男孩，你也是*

03:00.566 --> 03:06.033
- * Mermaid Man, crime-fighter
Barnacle Boy, makes do *
- * 美人鱼人，犯罪斗士
藤壶男孩，凑合*

03:06.033 --> 03:08.733
- * Evil found its match today
- * 邪恶今天找到了对手

03:08.733 --> 03:11.366
* Underwater justice and fair
play *
* 水下正义与公平
玩*

03:11.366 --> 03:16.866
both: *Super plan, garbage can,
minivan, Mermaid Man *
两者：*超级计划，垃圾桶，
小型货车、美人鱼人 *

03:16.866 --> 03:18.433
- Ahh!
- 啊！

03:18.433 --> 03:21.833
Will you two shut up about that
stupid show?
你们两个能闭嘴吗
愚蠢的表演？

03:21.833 --> 03:26.499
- Oh, did you say something
negative, Doctor Negative?
-哦，你说了什么吗
阴性，医生阴性？

03:26.499 --> 03:27.666
- What the--how did--
- 什么--怎么做--

03:27.666 --> 03:29.433
- I heard him say something
negative.
- 我听到他说了些什么
消极的。

03:29.433 --> 03:32.766
[toilet flushing]
[冲厕所]

03:32.766 --> 03:35.566
- Mermaid Man, that injured
victim's bandages
- 受伤的人鱼男
受害者的绷带

03:35.566 --> 03:36.733
have come undone.
已经被撤销了。

03:36.733 --> 03:39.266
- That poor man needs aid...
- 那个可怜的人需要援助......

03:39.266 --> 03:43.466
of the first variety.
第一个品种的。

03:43.466 --> 03:46.599
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

03:50.366 --> 03:53.333
- Oh,
we forgot the peroxide.
- 哦，
我们忘记了过氧化物。

03:53.333 --> 03:56.433
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

03:56.433 --> 03:58.133
- That should hold you until the
surgeons
- 这应该能支撑你直到
外科医生

03:58.133 --> 03:59.666
can amputate your torso.
可以截肢你的躯干。

03:59.666 --> 04:01.533
- Hmmph.
[mumbling]
- 哼。
[咕哝]

04:01.533 --> 04:03.233
both: Justice restored!
两人：正义恢复！

04:03.233 --> 04:07.733
- Hey, super dorks, your turn to
take out the garbage.
- 嘿，超级傻瓜，轮到你了
把垃圾倒掉。

04:08.866 --> 04:11.633
- All right, Dr. Negative, we'll
play
- 好吧，阴性博士，我们会
玩

04:11.633 --> 04:13.266
along and take it out.
并把它拿出来。

04:13.266 --> 04:14.766
Hiyah!
嗨！

04:28.433 --> 04:29.566
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:29.566 --> 04:31.499
Why are all my tables
empty?
为什么我所有的桌子都是
空？

04:31.499 --> 04:33.666
Why am I not making money?
为什么我不赚钱？

04:33.666 --> 04:37.599
- Because these two costumed
creeps chased them out.
- 因为这两个人穿着戏服
怪物把他们赶了出去。

04:37.599 --> 04:39.233
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

04:39.233 --> 04:44.333
- Oh. Mr. Squidward, step into
me office.
- 哦。章鱼哥先生，介入
我的办公室。

04:44.333 --> 04:45.533
- Uh-oh, Patrick.
- 呃哦，帕特里克。

04:45.533 --> 04:48.133
I think we got Squidward in
trouble.
我想我们把章鱼哥带进来了
麻烦。

04:48.133 --> 04:51.299
- I'm gonna share a secret with
you that I never told anyone.
- 我要与人分享一个秘密
你我从来没有告诉过任何人。

04:51.299 --> 04:55.333
- Uh, that's okay.
I don't need to hear a...
- 呃，没关系。
我不需要听...

04:55.333 --> 04:56.766
Hmm?
唔？

04:58.633 --> 05:00.499
- Ha! Ha-ha.
You're a comic book geek.
- 哈！哈哈。
你是一个漫画书迷。

05:00.499 --> 05:02.266
- Ahh!
- 啊！

05:02.266 --> 05:03.633
Don't touch those.
不要碰那些。

05:03.633 --> 05:05.899
They're mint condition,
worth a fortune.
它们状况完好，
值一大笔钱。

05:05.899 --> 05:08.399
- So you read comics.
Don't worry.
- 所以你看漫画。
不用担心。

05:08.399 --> 05:11.599
Lots of perfectly immature
adults read comics.
很多完全不成熟
大人看漫画。

05:11.599 --> 05:16.766
- Oh, it's deeper than that.
- 哦，比那更深。

05:16.766 --> 05:18.633
I sewed it meself.
我自己缝的。

05:18.633 --> 05:21.233
It's Captain
Tightwad from issue 53.
是队长
来自第53期的吝啬鬼。

05:21.233 --> 05:23.599
They say he's a bad guy, but,
you know,
他们说他是个坏人，但是，
你知道，

05:23.599 --> 05:25.233
I think he's just
misunderstood.
我认为他只是
误解了。

05:25.233 --> 05:29.299
- Oh, look at that.
I think I left my oven on.
- 哦，看看那个。
我想我没关烤箱。

05:29.299 --> 05:33.833
- I had some fabric left over,
so I made this.
- 我还剩下一些布料，
所以我做了这个。

05:33.833 --> 05:37.566
- Oh, don't tell me...
Doctor Negative?
- 哦，别告诉我...
医生阴性？

05:37.566 --> 05:39.633
- Ahoy, you high-sea halfwits.
- 哎呀，你们这些白痴。

05:39.633 --> 05:41.733
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

05:41.733 --> 05:47.033
- Tremble before Captain
Tightwad!
- 在队长面前颤抖
紧绷！

05:47.033 --> 05:50.066
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

05:50.066 --> 05:54.533
- And cower in fear of Doctor
Negative.
- 因害怕医生而畏缩
阴性。

05:54.533 --> 05:55.566
- Holy shrimp.
- 圣虾。

05:55.566 --> 05:57.533
This is the best day of my life.
这是我一生中最美好的一天。

05:57.533 --> 06:00.533
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:00.533 --> 06:03.233
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:03.233 --> 06:05.233
both: Whoa! Oh!
两人：哇！哦！

06:05.233 --> 06:07.233
Whoa-ho! Whoa!
哇哦！哇！

06:07.233 --> 06:09.066
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:09.066 --> 06:11.399
- What're you waiting for?
- Augh!
- 你还在等什么？
- 啊啊！

06:11.399 --> 06:13.699
Ugh!
啊!

06:13.699 --> 06:17.066
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:17.066 --> 06:20.066
Ugh! Ow! Ow!
啊!噢！噢！

06:20.066 --> 06:23.233
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:28.599 --> 06:30.899
- Hyahhh!
- 哈啊！

06:34.233 --> 06:36.433
- Why are we fighting Captain
Tightwad?
- 为什么我们要和队长战斗
吝啬？

06:36.433 --> 06:37.933
He didn't even commit a
crime.
他甚至没有犯
犯罪。

06:37.933 --> 06:39.466
- What--what do you mean?
- 什么-什么意思？

06:39.466 --> 06:40.766
- Oh, Mr. Krabs, it's right here
in
-哦，蟹老板，就在这里
在

06:40.766 --> 06:42.233
"Mermaid Man" number 98.
《人鱼男》98号。

06:42.233 --> 06:44.599
"No superhero shall fight a
super villain
“任何超级英雄都不会与
超级恶棍

06:44.599 --> 06:47.599
until that super villain
has committed a crime."
直到那个超级反派
已经犯罪了。”

06:47.599 --> 06:49.799
- Uh...well...hey.
- 呃...好吧...嘿。

06:53.033 --> 06:54.433
Ha-ha, see?
哈哈，看到了吗？

06:54.433 --> 06:56.533
I just stole some money.
我只是偷了一些钱。

06:56.533 --> 07:00.499
- Well, it's not really stealing
if it's your own money.
- 嗯，这并不是真正的偷窃
如果是你自己的钱。

07:00.499 --> 07:01.833
- Oh, come on.
- 哦，来吧。

07:01.833 --> 07:04.333
What do--what do I have to do
here?
What do——我必须做什么
在这里？

07:04.333 --> 07:05.966
- Ahh-ahh-ahh!
- 啊啊啊啊！

07:05.966 --> 07:07.833
- Are you sure about this?
- 你确定吗？

07:07.833 --> 07:09.933
Isn't robbing a bank against the
law?
抢银行不是针对
法律？

07:09.933 --> 07:11.966
- Well, yes, Mr. Krabs, but
you're not really
- 嗯，是的，蟹老板，但是
你不是真的

07:11.966 --> 07:14.066
robbing a bank.
You're just pretending to.
抢劫银行。
你只是假装而已。

07:14.066 --> 07:16.499
- And then we can play?
- Yep.
- 然后我们就可以玩了？
- 是的。

07:16.499 --> 07:18.233
- Oh, okay.
- 哦好的。

07:18.233 --> 07:19.566
Ahoy.
哎呀。

07:19.566 --> 07:21.099
Anyone home?
有人在家吗？

07:21.099 --> 07:23.999
It's Captain
Tightwad and Doctor Negative.
是队长
吝啬鬼和阴性医生。

07:23.999 --> 07:25.399
We're
here to rob you.
我们是
来这里抢劫你。

07:25.399 --> 07:26.766
Anyone here?
Hello?
这里有人吗？
你好？

07:26.766 --> 07:29.133
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

07:29.133 --> 07:31.299
Barnacled nickels.
藤壶镍币。

07:31.299 --> 07:32.866
Can I
help you ladies?
我可以吗
女士们，有帮助吗？

07:32.866 --> 07:35.066
- Oh, yeah, thanks, old-timer.
=> - 哦，是的，谢谢，老前辈。

07:35.066 --> 07:37.399
Um, we're pretending to rob this
bank.
嗯，我们假装抢劫这个
银行。

07:37.399 --> 07:39.599
Where's the tellers?
Where's the money?
出纳员在哪里？
钱在哪里？

07:39.599 --> 07:40.666
- Ain't no tellers.
- 没有出纳员。

07:40.666 --> 07:43.899
ATM's outside.
自动提款机就在外面。

07:43.899 --> 07:45.599
both: Heh-heh-heh-heh.
两人：呵呵呵呵。

07:45.599 --> 07:48.133
- Aw, barnacles.
I forgot me debit card.
- 噢，藤壶。
我忘记带借记卡了。

07:48.133 --> 07:49.566
- Wait a minute.
- 等一下。

07:49.566 --> 07:51.599
I don't care if you
are ladies.
我不在乎你是否
是女士们。

07:51.599 --> 07:54.666
Nobody pretends to rob
my bank.
没有人假装抢劫
我的银行。

07:54.666 --> 07:57.066
- [roars]
- Ahh!
- [咆哮]
- 啊！

07:57.066 --> 07:58.266
- Ahh!
- 啊！

07:58.266 --> 08:01.233
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:01.233 --> 08:02.466
Ow!
噢！

08:02.466 --> 08:04.699
Ehh...
呃...

08:04.699 --> 08:06.566
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

08:06.566 --> 08:08.566
- Whoa, you were so convincing.
- 哇，你太有说服力了。

08:08.566 --> 08:10.399
You
had that guard totally fooled.
你
那个守卫完全被愚弄了。

08:10.399 --> 08:12.499
I think we can skip to the end
of the story.
我想我们可以跳到最后
的故事。

08:12.499 --> 08:14.366
Let's just stop here to pick
up some props
让我们在这里停下来挑选
一些道具

08:14.366 --> 08:15.699
for your evil lair.
为了你邪恶的巢穴。

08:15.699 --> 08:18.966
We'll just need a few dollars...
yoink!
我们只需要几块钱...
哎哟！

08:18.966 --> 08:20.933
- I'm supposed to be the
villain,
- 我应该是
恶棍,

08:20.933 --> 08:24.666
so why do I feel like I'm being
robbed?
那么为什么我觉得我正在
抢劫？

08:26.366 --> 08:29.466
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:29.466 --> 08:32.299
- Okay Captain Tightwad...
- 好的，吝啬鬼船长...

08:32.299 --> 08:35.566
Doctor
Negative, you can come out now.
医生
否定的，你现在可以出来了。

08:35.566 --> 08:36.699
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

08:36.699 --> 08:40.199
both: Ahh!
两人：啊！

08:40.199 --> 08:42.033
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:42.033 --> 08:43.666
- Okay, so here's the scene.
- 好吧，这就是场景。

08:43.666 --> 08:46.366
You two have us here in this
cage over a pool of boiling oil.
你们两个让我们在这里
笼子放在一池沸腾的油上。

08:46.366 --> 08:47.899
Now, that is a
crime.
现在，那是一个
犯罪。

08:47.899 --> 08:49.566
Now you can let us out so we
can fight.
现在你可以让我们出去了所以我们
可以战斗。

08:49.566 --> 08:54.633
- Oh, I don't think we're going
to do that.
- 哦，我想我们不会去
这样做。

08:55.866 --> 08:57.766
- Hey, wha-wha-wha-what are you
doing?
- 嘿，哇，哇，哇，你是谁
在做什么？

08:57.766 --> 08:59.399
- Being evil.
- 作恶。

08:59.399 --> 09:00.899
Isn't that what you wanted?
这不是你想要的吗？

09:00.899 --> 09:02.666
Aren't you scared?
你不害怕吗？

09:02.666 --> 09:03.899
Boo-hoo?
号泣？

09:03.899 --> 09:07.233
- Boo-hoo?
Do you expect us to cry?
- 嘘？
你希望我们哭吗？

09:07.233 --> 09:08.466
- No, Mr. Bob.
- 不，鲍勃先生。

09:08.466 --> 09:10.266
I expect you to fry.
我期待着你去炒。

09:10.266 --> 09:11.666
[laughs]
[笑]

09:11.666 --> 09:13.366
- [laughs]
- [笑]

09:13.366 --> 09:14.966
Ha-ha, ha-ha, hmm.
哈哈哈哈哈哈，嗯。

09:14.966 --> 09:18.033
Okay, Squidward,
playtime's over.
好吧，章鱼哥，
游戏时间结束了。

09:18.033 --> 09:19.766
This is getting a
little intense here.
这是得到一个
这里有点激烈。

09:19.766 --> 09:24.699
- Too long have I suffered
living between you two ninnies.
-我受苦太久了
住在你们两个傻瓜中间。

09:24.699 --> 09:27.033
But now--
now as Doctor Negative,
但现在——
现在作为阴性医生，

09:27.033 --> 09:31.666
I shall finally exact my
exquisite revenge!
我最终将准确地表达我的
绝妙的复仇！

09:31.666 --> 09:33.766
[laughs]
[笑]

09:33.766 --> 09:35.233
[both chuckling]
[两人都笑了]

09:35.233 --> 09:37.533
- See, I just knew he'd make a
terrific bad guy.
- 看吧，我就知道他会做一个
了不起的坏人。

09:37.533 --> 09:38.833
He is really
committing.
他真的是
承诺。

09:38.833 --> 09:41.299
- Yeah, you did a great job with
casting.
- 是的，你做得很好
铸造。

09:41.299 --> 09:44.366
- Could this be end of our
Doofus Duo?
- 这会是我们的结束吗
杜福斯二人组？

09:44.366 --> 09:49.133
Deep-fried like two tenacious
tater tots on tenterhooks?
炸得像两条顽强的
土豆泥们提心吊胆吗？

09:49.133 --> 09:52.599
- Swing, Boy Under.
Swing the basket.
- 摇摆，下面的男孩。
晃动篮子。

09:52.599 --> 09:54.999
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:59.933 --> 10:02.133
both: Ahh-ahh-ahh-ahh.
两人：啊啊啊啊啊啊。

10:02.133 --> 10:04.399
Ahhh!
啊啊！

10:12.799 --> 10:15.799
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:15.799 --> 10:23.866
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:23.866 --> 10:25.233
- Oh, boy, Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，天哪，蟹老板。

10:25.233 --> 10:28.266
That was the best Mermaid Man
playdate ever.
那是最好的人鱼男
永远的玩耍约会。

10:28.266 --> 10:29.899
- Yeah, not bad.
- 是的，还不错。

10:29.899 --> 10:32.899
But next time, we
won't go so easy on ya.
但下一次，我们
不会对你那么容易的。

10:32.899 --> 10:35.499
- Eh...
maybe I'll just stick to
- 呃...
也许我会坚持

10:35.499 --> 10:37.799
reading comics from now on.
从现在开始看漫画。

10:37.799 --> 10:40.366
both: To the Mermalair!
两人：前往美马拉尔！

10:40.366 --> 10:41.833
Ahh...oof!
啊……噢！

10:41.833 --> 10:44.433
- And so ends another
numskulled episode
- 另一个就这样结束了
愚蠢的情节

10:44.433 --> 10:46.133
of that preposterous pair:
那对荒谬的人：

10:46.133 --> 10:48.666
Mermaid Pants and Barnacle
Star.
美人鱼裤和藤壶
明星。

10:48.666 --> 10:52.399
Tune in next time for more
mind-rotting adventures.
下次记得关注更多内容
令人心碎的冒险。

10:52.399 --> 10:54.499
I've really got to find another
job.
我真的必须再找一个
工作。

10:54.499 --> 10:57.933
I wonder if it's too late to
go back to college radio?
我想知道现在是否太晚了
回到大学广播电台？

我想知道现在是否太晚了
回到大学广播电台？